    "chapter": "08 位运算与通信数据",
    "cReference": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n#include <string.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n#include <limits.h>\nint main(void){int n;unsigned long crc,byte;if(scanf(\"%d%lu\",&n,&crc)!=2)return 0;for(int i=0;i<n;i++){if(scanf(\"%lu\",&byte)!=1)return 0;crc^=byte;for(int bit=0;bit<8;bit++)crc=(crc&128UL)?((crc<<1)^7UL)&255UL:(crc<<1)&255UL;}printf(\"%lu\\n\",crc);return 0;}\n",
    "oracleNotes": "Independent GF(2) polynomial long division by x^8+x^2+x+1 (0x107), rather than the C per-byte/per-bit update loop."
  }
